      "role": "user",
      "content": "the thing is i don't have anyone to reach out to. i did this on purpose. i cut the ties so i wouldn't have to deal with the mess of people, and now i've just succeeded too well. it's like i'm in a vacuum. there's no air, no sound, just this constant weight. i feel like i've reached the logical conclusion of my own life and there's just nothing left on the other side of this wall. it's just a dead end.",
